---
const repo = 'https://github.com/0xHelico/helico'
const swapPlan = `${repo}/blob/main/docs/plans/2026-09-05-vault-swap-recentre.md`
const facts = [
	{ n: '240+', unit: 'unit tests', copy: '52 in the Uniswap plugin, 116 in the CRE plugin, 74 in the vault; CI runs them on every pull request.' },
	{ n: '9', unit: 'fork tests', copy: 'that mint, swap, and re-centre against a fork of Arbitrum One.' },
	{ n: '12', unit: 'AI audit agents', copy: 'ran over the vault before its rewrite; a six-agent pass followed. Not a professional audit, and not called one.' },
	{ n: '4', unit: 'networks exercised', copy: 'Base Sepolia and Robinhood Chain Testnet with real transactions, Robinhood Chain mainnet read-only, Arbitrum One on a fork.' },
	{ n: '3', unit: 'ways to check one digest', copy: 'the EIP-712 authorisation matches between the enclave, the vault, and cast.' },
	{ n: 'MIT', unit: 'open source', copy: 'every plan, prompt, and AI-usage note committed alongside the code.' },
]
const bars = [
	{ label: 'Out of range, no swap', pct: 0, note: 'nothing can be minted' },
	{ label: 'In range, no swap', pct: 13, note: 'the rest went back to the wallet' },
]
---

<section class="wrap verified" id="verified" aria-labelledby="verified-title">
	<div class="section-card center">
		<span class="eyebrow">Helico</span>
		<h2 class="headline" id="verified-title">Verified by default</h2>
		<p class="lede">Every integration is tested against the real thing, and the README points at the lines that prove each claim.</p>
		<div class="actions">
			<a class="btn btn--secondary" href={`${repo}#readme`}>Learn more</a>
		</div>

		<div class="cards facts" style="text-align:left">
			{facts.map((f) => (
				<div class="card">
					<div class="fact__n">{f.n} <small>{f.unit}</small></div>
					<p>{f.copy}</p>
				</div>
			))}
		</div>

		<div class="split">
			<div>
				<h3>Why the swap is inside the vault.</h3>
				<p>An out-of-range position holds one token. Burn it and mint a new range without a swap, and the pool cannot take the second side: nothing is minted out of range, and 13% survives in range. These two rows are the reason the vault swaps between the burn and the mint.</p>
			</div>
		</div>
		<div class="card chart" style="text-align:left">
			<div class="chart__head">
				<span>Liquidity a re-centre keeps without a swap</span>
				<span class="chart__legend">share of the position's liquidity</span>
			</div>
			<ul class="bars">
				{bars.map((b) => (
					<li>
						<span class="bars__label">{b.label}</span>
						<span class="bars__track"><span class="bars__fill" style={`width:${Math.max(b.pct, 1)}%`}></span></span>
						<span class="bars__pct">{b.pct}%</span>
						<span class="bars__note">{b.note}</span>
					</li>
				))}
			</ul>
			<p class="chart__foot">
				Measured against a live pool before the swap existed and recorded in
				<a href={swapPlan}>the swap plan</a>. How much the swap path keeps depends on the pool at the
				time, so it is not charted here.
			</p>
		</div>
	</div>
</section>

<style>
	.verified {
		margin-top: 2rem;
	}
	.facts {
		margin-top: clamp(2rem, 4vw, 3rem);
	}
	.fact__n {
		font-size: 1.6rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		letter-spacing: -0.02em;
		color: var(--color-ink);
	}
	.fact__n small {
		display: block;
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		font-weight: 500;
		letter-spacing: 0;
		color: #5d4ce6;
	}
	.chart {
		padding: 1.5rem;
	}
	.chart__head {
		display: flex;
		flex-wrap: wrap;
		justify-content: space-between;
		gap: 0.5rem;
		font-weight: 600;
		font-size: 0.95rem;
	}
	.chart__legend {
		font-weight: 500;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: #5b6270;
	}
	.bars {
		list-style: none;
		margin: 1.25rem 0 0;
		padding: 0;
		display: flex;
		flex-direction: column;
		gap: 0.9rem;
	}
	.bars li {
		display: grid;
		grid-template-columns: 1fr auto;
		grid-template-areas:
			'label pct'
			'track track'
			'note note';
		gap: 0.3rem 0.75rem;
		align-items: center;
		font-size: 0.85rem;
	}
	.bars__label {
		grid-area: label;
		font-weight: 500;
	}
	.bars__pct {
		grid-area: pct;
		font-family: var(--font-mono);
		font-size: 0.8rem;
		color: #4c3fd6;
	}
	.bars__track {
		grid-area: track;
		height: 0.6rem;
		border-radius: 9999px;
		background: #efecff;
		overflow: hidden;
	}
	.bars__fill {
		display: block;
		height: 100%;
		border-radius: inherit;
		background: linear-gradient(90deg, #7c6bff, #b7abff);
	}
	.bars__note {
		grid-area: note;
		font-size: 0.75rem;
		color: #5b6270;
	}
	@media (min-width: 640px) {
		.bars li {
			grid-template-columns: 14rem 1fr 3.5rem;
			grid-template-areas:
				'label track pct'
				'label note pct';
		}
	}
	.chart__foot {
		margin: 1rem 0 0;
		font-size: 0.78rem;
		line-height: 1.55;
		color: #5b6270;
	}
	.chart__foot a {
		color: #5d4ce6;
		font-weight: 600;
	}
</style>
